      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, with the addition of custom emotes for VRC+, these are not fully regulated by VRC moderation and could potentially be offensive; adding the mask that hides emotes would give streamers more control on the content of their streams and assurance that no offense content would come through their streams potentially risking a violation on their streaming platform of choice.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
