  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-25T13:28:36.556Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Lately a lot of music events and concerts have occurring in VRChat lately and enthusiastic players often spam emotes to show their enjoyment; However, some people in these events want to take photos in these events, some event staff's literal job is to take photos. The emote spam often gets in the way of the camera, essentially ruining what would normally beautiful concert photo.\n\nAdding an additional mask to the camera would help filmmakers and photographers at events create even better VRC event photos.\n\nCamera settings such as \"green screen\" and \"environment\" already remove these emotes, however, that also removes the background of what would be a beautiful concert and cinematic backdrop\n\nAdditionally, adding a \"hide emotes\" setting in the VRC setting tab would also help out a lot of people's frames in general as I have seen people crash due to so much emote spam.",
